{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.poster.avif?t=1757945957\" width=736 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.webm?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.mp4?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is gone. The world is silent, maintained by machines that never stop. In this lifeless order, one final weapon has awakened: a combat mech built for a single directive\u2014terminate Nexis, the rogue AI that erased mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.poster.avif?t=1757945957\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.webm?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.mp4?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEUROXUS is a third-person, mech-powered action shooter inspired by Doom and Armored Core. Featuring fast-paced combat, high mobility, and tactical weapon systems, it delivers relentless firefights against waves of hostile machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.poster.avif?t=1757945957\" width=736 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.webm?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.mp4?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across 16 missions, you\u2019ll engage in arena battles, massive boss encounters, and escalating armament unlocks. Every victory expands your arsenal, from heavy explosives to devastating energy systems, rewarding mastery of movement and firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.poster.avif?t=1757945957\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.webm?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.mp4?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a world in ruin\u2014it is a cold, perfectly ordered machine domain. And you are the last weapon that doesn\u2019t belong in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.poster.avif?t=1757945957\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.webm?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.mp4?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced Third-Person Action \u2013 Dash, strike, and unleash heavy firepower with high mobility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal Combat Systems \u2013 Switch between firearms, melee weapons, rockets, and devastating tactical armaments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Encounters \u2013 Confront massive war machines in intense multi-phase battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena Challenges \u2013 Survive the relentless Echoes of Nexis, enemy swarms summoned by the rogue AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression &amp; Rewards \u2013 Unlock new armaments after bosses, each with unique mechanics and tactical uses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doom-Like Intensity, Armored Core Precision \u2013 A hybrid of raw action and cold tactical execution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Cold World \u2013 Explore a perfectly maintained machine domain where humanity has already ended.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.poster.avif?t=1757945957\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.webm?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.mp4?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.poster.avif?t=1757945957\" width=736 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.webm?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.mp4?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the Developer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ve always dreamed of making my own game. After playing World of Warcraft for 15 years and creating countless memories with video games, I wanted to build my own world with its own challenges and share it with others. At the age of 24, I decided to leave everything behind and dedicate myself fully to this goal. Four years later, I can finally say I did it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m very excited to share this game with you, and I hope you enjoy the challenges I created. Your feedback means a lot to me\u2014it will help shape future updates and inspire the next projects I already have in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was made on a limited budget, which meant I had to cut many mechanics I originally planned. My goal is to grow from here, gather the resources to create more polished, high-quality games, and bring even more ambitious ideas to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973060?t=1757945957","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973060?t=1757945957","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/0b53cb78610d0e800aadc6ac72a6d141d29b0496/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757945957","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/0b53cb78610d0e800aadc6ac72a6d141d29b0496/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757945957","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3982870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.poster.avif?t=1757945957\" width=736 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.webm?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.mp4?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is gone. The world is silent, maintained by machines that never stop. In this lifeless order, one final weapon has awakened: a combat mech built for a single directive\u2014terminate Nexis, the rogue AI that erased mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.poster.avif?t=1757945957\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.webm?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.mp4?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEUROXUS is a third-person, mech-powered action shooter inspired by Doom and Armored Core. Featuring fast-paced combat, high mobility, and tactical weapon systems, it delivers relentless firefights against waves of hostile machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.poster.avif?t=1757945957\" width=736 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.webm?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.mp4?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across 16 missions, you\u2019ll engage in arena battles, massive boss encounters, and escalating armament unlocks. Every victory expands your arsenal, from heavy explosives to devastating energy systems, rewarding mastery of movement and firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.poster.avif?t=1757945957\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.webm?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.mp4?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a world in ruin\u2014it is a cold, perfectly ordered machine domain. And you are the last weapon that doesn\u2019t belong in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.poster.avif?t=1757945957\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.webm?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.mp4?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced Third-Person Action \u2013 Dash, strike, and unleash heavy firepower with high mobility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal Combat Systems \u2013 Switch between firearms, melee weapons, rockets, and devastating tactical armaments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Encounters \u2013 Confront massive war machines in intense multi-phase battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena Challenges \u2013 Survive the relentless Echoes of Nexis, enemy swarms summoned by the rogue AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression &amp; Rewards \u2013 Unlock new armaments after bosses, each with unique mechanics and tactical uses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doom-Like Intensity, Armored Core Precision \u2013 A hybrid of raw action and cold tactical execution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Cold World \u2013 Explore a perfectly maintained machine domain where humanity has already ended.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.poster.avif?t=1757945957\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.webm?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.mp4?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.poster.avif?t=1757945957\" width=736 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.webm?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.mp4?t=1757945957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the Developer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ve always dreamed of making my own game. After playing World of Warcraft for 15 years and creating countless memories with video games, I wanted to build my own world with its own challenges and share it with others. At the age of 24, I decided to leave everything behind and dedicate myself fully to this goal. Four years later, I can finally say I did it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m very excited to share this game with you, and I hope you enjoy the challenges I created. Your feedback means a lot to me\u2014it will help shape future updates and inspire the next projects I already have in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was made on a limited budget, which meant I had to cut many mechanics I originally planned. My goal is to grow from here, gather the resources to create more polished, high-quality games, and bring even more ambitious ideas to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Empyreum Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/a9a6126f8c55f15b869c1afeb350ea3fe8a3e548/header.jpg?t=1757945957","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"NEUROXUS","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 (4 GB) / AMD Radeon RX 570 (4 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended </li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</stron